## Completion criteria

This plan is complete only when:

- every SoulSearch candidate pipeline applies the implicit revealed-unit filter;
- `dfhack.units.isHidden()` is the sole authority for player-hidden semantics;
- hidden descriptors never enter user management, counts, presets, or settings;
- reset, preset, scoped-window, and multi-window paths cannot bypass the rule;
- focused, characterization, full-suite, build, package, and live DFHack gates
  are recorded above;
- the corresponding `docs/project.todo` item is marked done with a reference to
  this evidence.
